l":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4560110","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-858200-1846018067941075","game_id":"steam-858200","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updates Scratchin’ In: Support the Indies & Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Custom keybindings, a new challenge, new powerups, and even more of the new, new - spin our upgraded demo ahead of Steam Next Fest!September was a hustle, but the stage is set! We’re kicking off our newest demo update alongside two massive back-to-back events - starting today with Support the Indies, followed by Steam Next Fest next week!But first, no time for a paws - hit play on our Demo Update Trailer, lean back, and enjoy… then lean forward, grab your controller or keyboard, and try the demo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T14:10:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941075","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-858200-1842212951313510","game_id":"steam-858200","kind":"announcement","title":"Packing a punch: Demo, Dev Relays, and Showcases","summary":"We’re done chasing the sun and back in the saddle - squashing bugs, perfecting level design, fine-tuning animations, and so much more at the FlatPonies stables!We’re still tapping our hooves after dropping the Gameplay Trailer and going live with our demo for Six One Indie Demo Days. Between our team stampede at the DHL Relay and another showcase on the horizon (TODAY!), we've got plenty to share. Saddle up for the August rundown!Community Feedback & Bug HuntingSince pushing our demo LIVE, we’ve","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T14:05:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951313510","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-858200-1840310314339045","game_id":"steam-858200","kind":"update","title":"🐱 Scratch The Cat - Demo Update Notes","summary":"Hey everyone! We've just pushed a small update to the Scratch The Cat demo to polish up controls, smooth out movement, and fixed a few bug reports from you lovely players. Here is what’s new in this patch: 🎮 Controls & Gameplay Poleswing Jump Fixed: Resolved an issue where the poleswing jump was too short, giving Scratch proper distance again.Throw Aiming Arc: Improved the visual accuracy of the aim arc indicator when throwing items.Controller Layout Graphic Updated: Updated the controls menu to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T12:19:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314339045","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-858200-1839676055888212","game_id":"steam-858200","kind":"announcement","title":"🎧🐱 Play Scratch The Cat Demo NOW - LIVE at the Six One Indie Demo Days!","summary":"Grab your controller and relive 90s platformer nostalgia with ultra-smooth, slick movement - the official Scratch The Cat demo is LIVE on Steam right now for the Six One Indie Demo Days (July 31st – August 7th)!So if you’ve been itching for a vibrant 3D mascot platformer that blends nostalgic 90s collectathon fun with high-momentum, rhythm-driven movement... then the video game equivalent of a perfect mixtape has finally arrived.👉 PLAY THE DEMO NOW 🎬 WATCH THE TRAILER🎮 What is in the demo?Step i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T13:50:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055888212","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-858200-1835871199307464","game_id":"steam-858200","kind":"announcement","title":"MatchUp May & Scratch’s Cat-titude","summary":"Though we usually hide from the sun behind our screens - busy grooming Scratch the Cat here at the FlatPonies stables - we’ll soon be opening the stable doors to gallop into the summer sun.We promise not to stall for too long; we’ll be back in August with exciting news and fresh updates. Before we trot off to frolic, here is a quick look at what we've been up to throughout May and June!Copenhagen MatchUp: Connecting the DotsOur General Manager, Julie Heyde, and Writer & Communications Manager, J","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-19T15:16:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199307464","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-858200-1831432155571267","game_id":"steam-858200","kind":"announcement","title":"Curiosity Improves the Cat","summary":"Debug & Deploy: How player data is sharpening Scratch’s movesSoftware, much like a cat, is constantly adapting to its environment. Every jump, fall, and collision in our closed demo leaves a trail of data behind. In this month’s newsletter, we’re following that trail with our programmers to uncover the \"silent\" improvements being made to the game based on the patterns our playtesters left behind.We’re heading behind the scenes with programmer Jesper Andersson to see what really happens under the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-01T12:45:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155571267","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-858200-1829528821310553","game_id":"steam-858200","kind":"announcement","title":"Shaders and VFX: A Deep Dive into the Water","summary":"It’s time to talk about how we’re making a splash with our new water visuals - And how to join the closed demoWhile some have been diving into Easter eggs, we’ve been swimming in feedback at the FlatPonies barn! We recently opened the floodgates for limited community playtesting, and the response has been a total wave of positivity. But the waterworks don’t stop there - the atmosphere is getting a lot deeper this month as we transform how our water behaves and looks.Scratch taking a dip in one o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-10T15:46:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821310553","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-858200-1826362059924685","game_id":"steam-858200","kind":"announcement","title":"Theme song rapped by…","summary":"February is usually all about hearts, flowers, and questionable chocolate choices - but we traded the candy for controllers!We spent the month putting Scratch The Cat to the ultimate test at Copenhagen Gaming Week with TAGS. Moving from quiet school playtests to a massive convention was a \"heart-pounding\" shift, but even with flashy distractions everywhere, kids kept choosing Scratch and coming back for more. It’s safe to say we felt the love!We wrapped up the month with a rap: our official them","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-06T15:54:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059924685","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-858200-1823825466499672","game_id":"steam-858200","kind":"announcement","title":"Leveling up for Tomorrows Awesome Games Showcase and beyond!","summary":"January has been snowy and cold, and February is “snowing” us the same cold promise. But fear not...--you can warm up with us at Copenhagen Gaming Week, where you’ll find us at TAGS - Tomorrow’s Awesome Games Showcase, 12–14th February at Bella Center, Copenhagen.And that’s not all! We’ve got something exciting brewing, ready to be served some time after TAGS. Want to be the first in line? Then head to our Discord, and join in!Over the past month, we’ve laid down some of the final building block","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-06T13:52:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466499672","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-858200-1821288646581002","game_id":"steam-858200","kind":"announcement","title":"2025: Letting the Cat Out of the Bag","summary":"We ended December in snow, and we’re starting off January in… more snow!But we’re kicking off the year with some warm, fuzzy news: Scratch The Cat has been selected for the TAGS Showcase 2026!Our year ahead is already off to a great start - but before we hit play on 2026, let’s rewind a little. 2025 was all about letting the cat out of the bag: showing off Scratch, our development progress, team stories, and what makes this game tick (and scratch). Through our website and newsletters, we unpacke","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-09T13:54:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1821288646581002","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-858200-1818118366176363","game_id":"steam-858200","kind":"announcement","title":"The look and Sound of Collectibles","summary":"Remember, remember… all of November! We certainly do, as we’ve been busy polishing both our Christmas ornaments and our collectibles so they’ll shine (and sound) just right for the holidays.Lean in for a quick scoop from our Art Director and Sound Designer on what to expect from the collectibles in Scratch The Cat.Collectathon PlatformerScratch is on a quest to retrieve his scattered record fragments - and along the way, the happy collectathonner will find lots of goodies, some crucial for progr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-05T13:30:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366176363","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-858200-1815580768295513","game_id":"steam-858200","kind":"announcement","title":"Concepting The World of Scratch The Cat","summary":"October ended on a spooky note, so let’s start November on a cozy one with a little update from us - and some fresh visuals!Earlier this month, we joined Culture Night Copenhagen at Prosa, where players got a firsthand taste of Scratch The Cat. And if you caught our #Blocktober post, you’ve already seen a glimpse of Bluegrass Fields.Curious for more? Our artists have been bringing musical ideas to life - following the same rhythm - and now you can hear their thoughts behind the creations.Tyra on","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-07T13:57:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1815580768295513","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-858200-1811772772512364","game_id":"steam-858200","kind":"announcement","title":"The musical world of Scratch The Cat","summary":"We’re waking you up to our newsletter - just as September ends!We’re waking you up to our newsletter - just as September ends!This month, we’ve been fine-tuning levels, adding fresh music, and shaping the groovy world of Scratch The Cat. At its core, the game celebrates the classic ’90s platformers we grew up with - but with a twist: everything in this world, from buildings to enemies and platforms, is infused with music. So how does this musical world shape game development?Let’s hear from our ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-03T15:10:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772512364","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-858200-1809235871610752","game_id":"steam-858200","kind":"announcement","title":"From sketch to Scratch","summary":"Hey there, cool cats and fellow flat ponies!We’re back from summer break - and still buzzing with joy from the amazing response to the Scratch The Cat announcement trailer at The Six One Indie Showcase. Thanks for all the love, feedback, and purrs of excitement!Even though the announcement trailer has dropped, that doesn’t mean the workload has - there’s still a ways to go before the final game is ready for a spin!Behind the Scratch: A Quick Look Back As our Creative Director, Felix Sherar, reve","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-29T06:51:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1809235871610752","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-858200-1800357164411857","game_id":"steam-858200","kind":"announcement","title":"🐱Scratch The Cat is Dropping the Beat – and its Announcement Trailer!","summary":"We’re FlatPonies — a passionate indie team straight from the barn in Copenhagen - and we’re thrilled to drop the record needle on our upcoming game: Scratch The Cat! We’re putting all our horsepower behind one funky 